                  </p>
                </div>

                <div className="overflow-x-auto">
                  <table className="min-w-full divide-y divide-[#C8A45D/30]/50">
                    <thead>
                      <tr className="bg-[#F5F6FA]">
                        <th className="py-3 px-4 text-left text-xs font-medium text-[#00717F] uppercase tracking-wider">
                          Nom Complet
                        </th>
                        <th className="py-3 px-4 text-left text-xs font-medium text-[#00717F] uppercase tracking-wider">
                          Genre
                        </th>
                        <th className="py-3 px-4 text-left text-xs font-medium text-[#00717F] uppercase tracking-wider">
                          Emplacement
                        </th>
                        <th className="py-3 px-4 text-left text-xs font-medium text-[#00717F] uppercase tracking-wider">
                          Repas Préférés
